    {
      "id": "c6089dc1-760d-4372-9838-29b1482d0e1b",
      "title": "Observe a mesma dupla e perceba que a comparação agora coloca os dois no mesmo nível.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "863ddcc0-7847-4f0b-86cb-2a76121b759f",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora os dois aparecem no mesmo nível.</p><p><strong>Hugo es tan serio como Leo.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Hugo é tão sério quanto Leo.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fa695a237a2140788b87819ed81e749e_l05b01-two-men-office-contrast.png?Expires=1794099551&Signature=m90gZc8DRtOGlvBkJiu64jZN5yBPt73qByTodeJM1vZ9em5yz9lARMMK6qwIO8AXV~i9SaUJE0fHYljsEcX5ebwQ4OYBEC4~F~15CnhneyGoOmGCZnEBqDKG2r6jcom8oQJfnVUropSpgEIj4S4QYvDUlWYIe2Qq8hbuhcdSHR8V4d6T9ITZV3xqnoIKhZCdL6D0DVAc3A9lfRTJDQjM1olGgpsbaZbWwNcWEImu4YT-fvC~6LgDYLvP~PI2XSDXrfMZbEk3Rk8bZOjk49lH6SGBY0bJBlw0xlzqJMlyIL1T5s0vE9IVVP52MdIByJU63MAhXvy206iveh1Kk2aoUQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/2cd762f4f6574249bb76354b74f13276_l05b03-hugo-es-tan-serio-como-leo.mp3?Expires=1794099551&Signature=i0sAGX0mIy6AbMVHVxaxvACFbSerCqLqiXP0D0lKm54-IMe3Duh-XncqmUxKUmZ8AwHgW9wpvNYwWGtwZP20na67K7Wi9x7KNSPKL6k5mIsYyZotJrg6uetsfkm5u7dmugH3Vn-fuQ12JlwUEACQJBR6sBrNAtjwfYoWXb3tWRATs0DYJXAEfoC~cXFffTjsXJKm3O5YUl7HIAdkIPsuWE2B2GCdR24E45PqhlE-02xRv2rPETXDHzZ9iag64XGhJxer1I4uL2c-6zmMcVoVrg5UqlLhXdh444v6H9LHolxVkDORD5FOHmL8kAhoSoAEpRFfay2h2UBtk5dQpVT~PQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
